(Đếm lại tiền mặt)" style="shape=mxgraph.bpmn.shape;html=1;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;verticalAlign=top;align=center;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;outlineConnect=0;outline=catching;symbol=link;fillColor=#e8f5e9;strokeColor=#2e7d32;fontSize=10;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="lane_6">
